		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Flesh-robed ogre with no face that totes a bizarre staff, its attractor. Seeks to undo Law in all forms, beings of the Negative Energy Plane.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 63, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 slam +8 (2d6) and 1 attractor, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +5, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +5, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 13</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Attractor</strong>. Staff made of strange metal. Creatures within double near, STR 15+ on turn or else move towards attractor, stuck fast, cannot move away.</p><p></p><p><strong>Great Evil</strong>. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Spacetime Shifting</strong>. Warps space and time, attacks against hundun have DISADV.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
